\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. From Thee all skill and science  flow,
\par All pity, care, and love,
\par All calm and courage, faith and hope:
\par O pour them from above;
\par And part them, Lord, to each and all,
\par As each and all shall need,
\par To rise like incense, each to Thee,
\par In noble thought and deed.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. And hasten, Lord, that perfect day
\par When pain and death shall cease,
\par And Thy just  rule shall fill the earth
\par With health, and light, and peace;
\par When ever blue the sky shall gleam,
\par And ever green the sod,
\par And man's rude work deface no more
\par The paradise of God.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

